{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"On 2026-09-04, plan_review_status for goldfilled-portly-dungbeetle returned stale-store: the MCP server ticket clone has diverged from the shared store, so it refuses certification. The repository-local CLI on the isolated current-origin/main worktree saw the same ticket normally and returned the expected unsigned status. Gate operations are switching to the local CLI fallback; no force."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788584888652207001,"uuid":"392b2eda-29ee-4377-897e-fe137dcdce85"}